# Build context for the release images (deploy/image), which the regtest setup also runs: an allowlist.
# Only go.mod, go.sum, vendor/, the Go sources and the three files checkout embeds are sent.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!vendor
!**/*.go
!checkout/page.html
!checkout/style.css
!checkout/logo.svg
# Re-excluded after the allowlist: tests, and directories whose Go files no image build needs.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
.git
.worktrees
.tools
.superpowers
internal
dev
qualify
